        "body": "If the destination is another team, the conflict packet is not closed until that team acknowledges the handoff. If the destination value differs from the approved value, keep the case open and route the variance. The reopen reason should use the same reason codes as the exception queue so patterns are visible. Check the destination field, not only the activity log, because a note can be added without changing the record.\n\nA sent message, a closed ticket, or a verbal yes is not proof that the conflict packet outcome reached the record. Compare the matter intake, the approval, and the final value in the deadline calendar before marking the conflict packet complete. A reopened case should show what changed, who noticed it, and which earlier decision is now in question. Check the destination field, not only the activity log, because a note can be added without changing the record."
