    "slug": "legalservicesoffshore-separate-preparation-from-approval-in-document-index",
    "title": "Separate preparation from approval in document index",
    "excerpt": "A grounded legal support operations note for law firm administrators: document index with explicit evidence, decision rights, and a verified close.",
